{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1412334055"}, "name":{"label":"Sass ‘O Frass ☺️🎀🫰🏼💅🏼"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-06T20:27:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.25.0"}, "id":{"label":"13930891253"}, "title":{"label":"My view on the Couple Joy - Relationship App"}, "content":{"label":"I appreciate and enjoy how this app helps couples get into the thick of it with certain topics that help couples have the more difficult conversations that are necessary to help couples navigate through their relationship, learn and grow stronger together and become more of a team. \n\nI love how certain prompts help create a dialogue between couples to help their communication skills, help find the necessary tools to improve when necessary to help each partner find ways to communicate and connect that help each partner in their own way. \n\nThere are some topics that were not as concise, clear and helpful on how a person could respond, but for the most part it has helped my partner and myself become more open minded, improve our ability to communicate and discuss important topics and issues that we both needed to discuss to help us learn and grow as a couple and help us grow as individuals as well. Thank you!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
